WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.200
After a recovery, files come back like this.

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.200
Strange names, small previews, copies, damaged files.

3
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.200
Choose your recovery folder, and Upsort sorts it.

4
00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:15.100
It reads only that folder, on your computer.

5
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:20.700
Set aside, not deleted. You can keep any of them.

6
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:27.600
Sorted by date taken. Unselect what you don't want.

7
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:33.200
You save new copies, sorted by year and month.

8
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Your photos stay on your computer. Nothing is deleted.

9
00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:40.000
Upsort. Made for recovered files. Free, and it runs in your browser.
